    '900点到達者の多くは、語彙→文法（Part5）→公式音源のシャドーイング→Part対策→公式問題集の通し演習、の順で進めていました。共通していたのは「教材を増やさず、同じ公式音源と模試を繰り返す」ことです。単語帳を1周で終わらせる、書き取り中心、30日で+400点を狙うやり方は、再現されにくい傾向でした。学習時間の目安は、IIBCの「100点あたり約300時間」（自己学習でも同程度）に合わせ、500→900で約1000〜1300時間です。',
    '[{"title":"金のフレーズの使い方（english-route）","url":"https://english-route.com/kinhure-tukaikata/","kind":"expertArticles"},{"title":"TOEIC 900点の単語学習と金フレ（森くんのメメント）","url":"https://forest-memento.com/toeic-900-words-kinhure-based/","kind":"achieverBlogs"},{"title":"文法特急の使い方（english-route）","url":"https://english-route.com/toeic-bunpoutokkyu/","kind":"expertArticles"},{"title":"TOEIC 900点の勉強法（native-real）","url":"https://native-real.com/articles/toeic-900-study-plan/","kind":"educationMedia"},{"title":"TOEIC900の勉強法（StudyChain）","url":"https://studychain.jp/media/toeic-900-study-highschool/","kind":"educationMedia"},{"title":"TOEICシャドーイングの手順（桐原Online Academy）","url":"https://academy.kirihara.co.jp/blog/toeic/toeic-shadowing-study-guide/","kind":"expertArticles"},{"title":"Part3・4はシャドーイング（English Lab）","url":"https://englishlab.jp/2021/10/22/toeic_part3_part4/","kind":"expertArticles"},{"title":"Part3・4は音読とシャドーイング（TOEICで500点スコアアップ）","url":"https://toeic-500up.com/2016/12/toeic-part3.html","kind":"achieverBlogs"},{"title":"公式問題集の使い方（native-real）","url":"https://native-real.com/articles/toeic-official-materials-guide/","kind":"educationMedia"},{"title":"公式問題集の3周復習法（桐原Online Academy）","url":"https://academy.kirihara.co.jp/blog/toeic/toeic-official-workbook-study-method/","kind":"expertArticles"},{"title":"IIBC 公式教材の音声","url":"https://www.iibc-global.org/toeic/support/prep/download_audios.html","kind":"official"},{"title":"IIBC 公式問題集11","url":"https://www.iibc-global.org/toeic/support/prep/lr_ud_11/pr.html","kind":"official"},{"title":"IIBC 公式教材・問題集","url":"https://www.iibc-global.org/toeic/support/prep.html","kind":"official"},{"title":"IIBC 目標スコアと学習時間","url":"https://www.iibc-global.org/toeic/support/study_methods/methods07.html","kind":"official"},{"title":"Reddit r/japanlife TOEIC advice","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/japanlife/comments/33cj2r/need_some_advice_from_english_teachersanyone_who/","kind":"reddit"},{"title":"金フレの使い方（amirohblog）","url":"https://amirohblog.com/